    <bpmn:process id="W_W2593" name="W2593. Shared Services Staff Productivity &amp; Capacity Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly planning cycle
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~518 active HQ staff across shared services (profile §3.3, promoted 2026-09-14; gap-filled 2026-09-18; HQ 518 active of the TO&#x27;s 532-role design — Trade / Account Management disabled — prepared 2026-09-23 (x) and the TPS build squad deferred — prepared (ad), sourcing register §4, registry CAP-B01)
Owner: HR Business Partner
Participants: HR BP, Finance Controller, COO
Source: workflow W2593 — Shared Services Staff Productivity &amp; Capacity Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2593_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2593_Lane1" name="HR Business Partner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2593_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2593_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2593_Lane2" name="Finance Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2593_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2593_Lane3" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2593_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2593_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2593_Start5" name="Quarterly planning cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2593_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2593_Task6" name="HR Business Partner compiles shared services productivity metrics: transactions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR Business Partner compiles shared services productivity metrics: transactions per FTE per function, overtime hours, error rates, customer satisfaction scores from internal surveys; identifies capacity constraints and surplus areas
Responsible (R): HR Business Partner
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: 2–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2593_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2593_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2593_Task7" name="Finance Controller correlates productivity with cost trends: determines if cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance Controller correlates productivity with cost trends: determines if cost increases are volume-driven (justified) or efficiency-driven (action needed); proposes staffing adjustments (hire, redeploy, automate) with financial impact modeling
Responsible (R): Finance Controller / HR BP
Accountable (A): CFO / CHRO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2593_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2593_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2593_Task8" name="COO reviews shared services capacity plan: approves staffing changes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: COO reviews shared services capacity plan: approves staffing changes, prioritizes automation investments, sets productivity improvement targets; incorporates into annual operating plan
Responsible (R): COO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
