      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2594_Start4" name="Annual documentation cycle or BIR audit trigger">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2594_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2594_Task5" name="Finance Controller compiles transfer pricing documentation: intercompany…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Controller compiles transfer pricing documentation: intercompany transaction analysis, functional analysis (FAR — functions, assets, risks), benchmarking study, allocation methodology documentation, entity-by-entity profit analysis; engages external TP advisor for annual update
Responsible (R): Finance Controller / External TP Advisor
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 4–6 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2594_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2594_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2594_Task6" name="External advisor reviews documentation for BIR compliance: confirms…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: External advisor reviews documentation for BIR compliance: confirms arm&#x27;s-length pricing methodology, validates benchmarking approach per BIR Revenue Regulation guidelines, prepares TP report per Philippine requirements
Responsible (R): External TP Advisor
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–3 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2594_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2594_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2594_Task7" name="Finance Controller files transfer pricing documentation with BIR (mandatory for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance Controller files transfer pricing documentation with BIR (mandatory for related party transactions); maintains documentation for potential BIR audit; updates methodology annually based on business changes and regulatory updates
Responsible (R): Finance Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2594_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2594_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2594_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2594_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
