        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-447 (ensure controlled execution — Shared Services Performance &amp; Analytics (PA-72.3).) | - CTL-447 (TP arm&#x27;s-length — links to W235); CTL-213 (entity-profitability &amp; chargeback accuracy); operational: CFO + CEO review of allocation equity
Owner: FP&amp;A Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
